## 2. Six-Pillar Feature Architecture

### Pillar 1: 💬 Community & Social Layer

| Feature | Description | Inspired By |
|---|---|---|
| **Neighborhood Feed** | Location-gated posts within configurable radius (2–10 km) | Jodel's geofenced feed |
| **Sub-Group Chats** | Topic-specific rooms: "Society Sports", "Carpooling", "Local Events", "Parents" | Nextdoor Groups |
| **Requirement Board** | "Request Anything" feed — users post needs, admin/community responds | Unique to HyperLocal |
| **Direct Messaging** | 1:1 private chat with proxy number masking option | Neighbors by Ring |
| **Meet & Plan** | Users can create local meetup events, RSVP, and coordinate | Nyburs Events |
| **Upvote/Downvote** | Community-moderated content with karma system | Jodel's karma model |
