### Pillar 5: 🚚 On-Demand Local Delivery System

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is the most technically complex pillar. It implements a **three-way real-time system** comparable to Swiggy/Zomato but scoped to the local neighborhood.

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Delivery Agent Registration** | Users register as local delivery agents (bicycle/scooter/walking) |
| **Order Placement** | Users order from local shops or request custom pickups |
| **Agent Assignment** | Nearest available agent auto-assigned or admin-assigned |
| **Live GPS Tracking** | Real-time map tracking with agent location updates every 5–10 seconds |
| **Status Milestones** | Pending → Assigned → Picked Up → En Route → Delivered |
| **Geofencing** | Auto-status updates when agent enters shop/delivery zones |
| **ETA Calculation** | Real-time ETA using Google Maps Distance Matrix API |
| **Delivery Fee Engine** | Distance-based automatic fee calculation |
| **Agent Payout** | Transparent payout tracking for agents |
| **Order History** | Complete delivery history for users, agents, and shops |
| **Rating System** | Users rate agents; agents rate shops |

#### Three-Way Delivery Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant S as 🏪 Shop
    participant A as 🚴 Delivery Agent
    participant Sys as ⚙️ System/Admin
    
    U->>Sys: Place order from Shop X
    Sys->>S: New order notification
    S->>Sys: Accept order, start preparing
    Sys->>Sys: Find nearest available agent
    Sys->>A: Delivery request (Shop → User address)
    A->>Sys: Accept delivery
    Sys->>U: "Agent assigned: Rahul 🚴" + Live map opens
    
    Note over A,U: Live GPS tracking begins (5-sec intervals)
    
    A->>S: Arrives at shop
    Sys->>U: Status: "Agent at shop"
    S->>A: Hand over package
    S->>Sys: Mark "Ready & Picked Up"
    Sys->>U: Status: "Out for delivery" + Updated ETA
    
    A->>U: Arrives at delivery location
    Sys->>U: Status: "Agent has arrived"
    A->>Sys: Mark "Delivered" + Photo proof
    Sys->>U: "Order delivered! Rate your experience"
    Sys->>A: Payout credited to wallet
```

