## 3. Technology Stack

### Recommended Stack (Production-Grade)

| Layer | Technology | Justification |
|---|---|---|
| **Mobile App** | **React Native** (or Flutter) | Single codebase for Android + iOS; large ecosystem; hot reload |
| **Backend API** | **Node.js + Express.js** | Handles concurrent requests, real-time data, heavy chat loads |
| **Database** | **PostgreSQL + PostGIS** | Complex geospatial queries (e.g., "Find all electricians within 2km") in O(log N) |
| **Cache & Pub/Sub** | **Redis** | Real-time WebSocket coordination, session caching, feed caching |
| **Real-Time Chat** | **Socket.io** | Persistent WebSocket connections for live chat + delivery tracking |
| **Push Notifications** | **Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)** | Background notifications when app is closed |
| **Maps & Geocoding** | **Google Maps SDK + Places API + Distance Matrix API** | Society mapping, auto-complete, ETA calculation, live tracking |
| **File Storage** | **AWS S3 / Firebase Storage** | Shop photos, user avatars, property images, delivery proofs |
| **Authentication** | **Firebase Auth + Custom JWT** | Phone OTP, Google Sign-in, secure token management |
| **SMS/Voice Proxy** | **Twilio Proxy API** | Anonymous contact between users (privacy-preserving) |
| **Payment Gateway** | **Razorpay / PhonePe SDK** | UPI, cards, wallets — India-optimized |
| **Admin Panel** | **React.js + Material UI** | Web-based admin dashboard |
| **CI/CD** | **GitHub Actions + Fastlane** | Automated builds, testing, Play Store deployment |
| **Monitoring** | **Sentry + Firebase Crashlytics** | Error tracking, performance monitoring |
| **Analytics** | **Mixpanel / Firebase Analytics** | User behavior, funnel analysis, retention |

### Architecture Decision Records

> [!NOTE]
> **Why PostgreSQL + PostGIS over MongoDB?**
> MongoDB's geospatial queries use flat-Earth approximation for `$near` queries. PostGIS uses true spherical/ellipsoidal calculations with GiST indexes, providing **accurate distance computation** critical for delivery fee calculation and geofencing. PostGIS reduces spatial queries from O(N) to O(log N).

> [!NOTE]
> **Why React Native over Flutter?**
> Both are excellent choices. React Native is recommended for JavaScript ecosystem familiarity (same language as Node.js backend), larger community, and easier integration with existing npm packages. Flutter is the alternative if the team prefers Dart and wants pixel-perfect UI control. **Either works — pick based on team skills.**

