## 12. Regulatory Compliance

### India-Specific Compliance

| Regulation | Requirement | Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| **IT Act 2000 (India)** | Data localization, user consent | Servers in India (AWS Mumbai), explicit consent flows |
| **Personal Data Protection Bill** | Consent-based data collection | Granular permission controls, data deletion on request |
| **FSSAI** (if food delivery) | Food safety compliance for delivery | Shop food license verification during onboarding |
| **GST Compliance** | Tax collection on premium services | Razorpay handles GST invoicing |
| **Intermediary Guidelines 2021** | Content moderation, grievance officer | Admin moderation panel, appointed grievance officer |

### Data Privacy Measures

- **Twilio Proxy**: All user-to-user calls/SMS routed through temporary proxy numbers
- **Location Obfuscation**: Safety posts show nearest intersection, not exact address (Neighbors by Ring pattern)
- **Right to Erasure**: Users can delete account and all associated data
- **Consent Collection**: Explicit opt-in for location tracking, notifications, data sharing
- **Data Encryption**: AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit

