## 16. Risk Assessment & Mitigation

| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Google Maps API costs spiral** | High | Medium | Start with status-based tracking; use OpenStreetMap for non-critical maps; cache routes |
| **Cold start problem** (no users/shops) | Critical | High | Physical on-ground onboarding of 50+ shops before user launch; seed content |
| **Real-time system scalability** | High | Medium | Redis Pub/Sub for horizontal scaling; partition by pincode zones |
| **User trust & safety** | Critical | Medium | Multi-layer verification; admin moderation; proxy numbers; content filtering |
| **Delivery agent reliability** | High | Medium | Rating system; minimum delivery requirement; instant payout incentives |
| **Regulatory changes** | Medium | Low | Modular compliance layer; appointed grievance officer; data localization |
| **Competition from Nextdoor/Nyburs** | Medium | Medium | Differentiate with delivery + jobs (no competitor has both); hyper-local focus |

